      { "As they burst out of the cave, they flop onto familiar ground. They pant heavily as their friends, family and soon the entire village crowds around them in concern. \"W-we w-went in th-the c-cave, and heard s-something c-chasing us,\" %s stammers. Suddenly, %s starts crying. \"It was terrifying! If we hadn't made it out...\" \"I'm so sorry, %s,\" %s says. \"I should have listened to you. You were right all along, about everything.\" The two embrace, sobbing for a while as the others help care for them. They quickly make amends and promise never to let each other do anything like that again.",
